---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
	title="About Us" 
	description="Learn about CountDaysBetween.com and our mission to provide the simplest date calculation tools.">
	<section class="max-w-4xl mb-24 w-full mx-auto prose dark:prose-invert">
		<div class="prose-content w-full">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tighter mb-8" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">About CountDaysBetween</h1>
			<p class="text-xl text-body mb-8 leading-relaxed" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				Our mission is to provide the fastest, cleanest, and most accurate date calculation tools on the web.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">Who We Are</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				CountDaysBetween was born out of a simple need: a date calculator that doesn't feel like it's from 1995. We believe that utility tools should be beautiful, fast, and respectful of your privacy.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">Why Use Our Tools?</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				Most date calculators are cluttered with ads and slow to load. We've built our tools using modern web technologies to ensure they load instantly and work seamlessly on any device. Whether you're a project manager tracking deadlines or just curious how many days are left until your vacation, we've got you covered.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">Our Commitment</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				We are committed to keeping our tools free, ad-free, and privacy-focused. We don't track your calculations or store your data. We're just here to help you do the math.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>